This directory vendors the software AMBE+2 encoder from the OP25 project
(https://github.com/osmocom/op25), Copyright 2014-2017 Max H. Parke KA1RBI,
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see COPYING).

Files: ambe_encoder.{h,cc}, ambe_dequant.cc (op25's ambe.c),
ambe3600x2250_const.h, ambe3600x2400_const.h, op25_golay.h, and the
imbe_vocoder/ directory (fixed-point IMBE vocoder, GPL, by Pavel Yazev
and others, via OP25).

Local modifications: the p25p2_vf interleaver dependency was replaced by
dmr_pack.cc, which packs the encoder's 49-bit frames with Golay FEC and
mbelib-compatible pseudo-random modulation directly into mbelib's
ambe_fr[4][24] cell layout.

The decoder in the parent directory is mbelib (ISC license, see
../COPYRIGHT.mbelib).
